{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/827804-gifts-of-technology-and-really-big-things","id":827804,"title":"Gifts of Technology and Really Big Things.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-10T14:47:23-08:00","id":827804,"title":"Gifts of Technology and Really Big Things.","content":"Would the various Facets of the Gift of Technology work any different just because the object they are targeting is huge?<br /> I mean, I see nothing in the wording in Command Artifice or Iron Slave that'd imply that an aircraft carrier would behave any different from a cell phone, or a car.<br /> Considering that Unmake explicitly calls out size as a limiter, doesn't that imply that the other powers aren't working under that kind of limitation?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-10T15:15:24-08:00","id":827820,"title":"","content":"I'd have to double-check what I wrote and what my intent was at the time, but sure, off the top of my head I don't see why you can't possess an aircraft carrier with Iron Slave etc. There's not a lot you can then *do* with it that isn't 'move from a to b slowly' but even that is pretty terrifying if done at the right moment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-10T15:28:57-08:00","id":827828,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acrozatarim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/827804-gifts-of-technology-and-really-big-things?p=827820#post827820\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd have to double-check what I wrote and what my intent was at the time, but sure, off the top of my head I don't see why you can't possess an aircraft carrier with Iron Slave etc. There's not a lot you can then *do* with it that isn't 'move from a to b slowly' but even that is pretty terrifying if done at the right moment.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks!<br /> Any chance to imitate Alucard's entrance into London in Hellsing makes me happy. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-10T15:51:24-08:00","id":827838,"title":"","content":"As someone who routinely uses Command Artifice to order cars to 'tackle' enemies and pull over and stop with their prey inside them, I'm really hoping not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-10T17:15:11-08:00","id":827871,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/827804-gifts-of-technology-and-really-big-things?p=827838#post827838\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As someone who routinely uses Command Artifice to order cars to 'tackle' enemies and pull over and stop with their prey inside them, I'm really hoping not.</div> </div> </div> </div>So... you want to reenact that scene in metal gear solid 2.... the one where Arsenal Gear plows through New York?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-10T17:28:16-08:00","id":827878,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Almarck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/827804-gifts-of-technology-and-really-big-things?p=827871#post827871\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So... you want to reenact that scene in metal gear solid 2.... the one where Arsenal Gear plows through New York?</div> </div> </div> </div>EDIT: Oops, I was thinking MGS4.<br /> <br /> Yeah, like that.<br /> <br /> I just want to use it on a plane. And sort of tell the plane to tackle someone.<br /> <br /> I know it's horrible, on many levels, and based on what we know about our antagonists it would be complete overkill except for possibly one. But it's not about being nasty or anything, it just seems so over the top and epic. I figure if it needed to be done in a 'nicer' way he could just take the plane himself to ensure there's no passengers on it first and jump out before impact.<br /> <br /> So far my wolf has used Command Artifice on locks, telling them to open, security systems to turn off. I neglected to get the Warding gift that would make it much easier. He's used it on cell phones to create distractions, and told guns to 'go off' in the hands or holsters of others, made two cars pull over and stop, commanded three cars to just gun it and hit people, used it against some strange devices we came across to turn them against one another. I was using it so much that at one point when we walked into a dark room and my guy, in the lead, was instantly attacked, he spent his first turn and some of his last Essence telling the lights to turn on, rather than reaching for them. It's probably my most used Gift so far.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 02-10-2016, 08:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-16T17:53:09-08:00","id":831389,"title":"","content":"Could you possess a computer or a supercomputer and us yourself act like an AI, Much like the Machine or Someratin from person of interest?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10820-blakemikizuki","name":"Blakemikizuki","avatar":"ht